{"seq":1,"slug":"cascade-and-specificity","title":"层叠与优先级","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/css-and-visual-engineering/fundamentals/cascade-and-specificity","wordCount":810,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"层叠与优先级\">层叠与优先级</h1><h2 id=\"问题背景\">问题背景</h2><p>当多条 CSS 规则同时作用于同一个元素时，浏览器需要一套确定性的算法来决定&quot;谁赢&quot;。这套算法就是<strong>层叠（Cascade）</strong>。理解层叠的来源顺序、优先级计算和 <code>!important</code> 的行为，是写出可预测样式的基础；而 CSS 层叠层（<code>@layer</code>）则为大型项目提供了显式的优先级管理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>层叠</strong>是浏览器解决样式冲突的确定性算法，按固定顺序逐级比较：来源（origin）→ <code>!important</code> 层叠反转 → <code>@layer</code> 层叠层 → 选择器优先级 → 出现顺序，前者分出胜负就不再往后比；<strong>优先级（Specificity）</strong> 用 <code>(A, B, C)</code> 三元组量化选择器权重，而 <strong><code>@layer</code></strong> 让开发者能把优先级从选择器复杂度中解耦出来。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;样式声明&quot;] --&gt; B{&quot;来源 Origin&quot;}&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;用户代理样式&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; D[&quot;用户样式&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; E[&quot;作者样式&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F{&quot;层叠层 @layer&quot;}&#10;    F --&gt; G[&quot;层内优先级&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; H[&quot;层间优先级&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt; I{&quot;优先级 Specificity&quot;}&#10;    H --&gt; I&#10;    I --&gt; J{&quot;出现顺序 Order&quot;}&#10;    J --&gt; K[&quot;最终生效值&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"样式声明\"] --&gt; B{\"来源 Origin\"}\n    B --&gt; C[\"用户代理样式\"]\n    B --&gt; D[\"用户样式\"]\n    B --&gt; E[\"作者样式\"]\n    E --&gt; F{\"层叠层 @layer\"}\n    F --&gt; G[\"层内优先级\"]\n    F --&gt; H[\"层间优先级\"]\n    G --&gt; I{\"优先级 Specificity\"}\n    H --&gt; I\n    I --&gt; J{\"出现顺序 Order\"}\n    J --&gt; K[\"最终生效值\"]</pre><h2 id=\"层叠来源\">层叠来源</h2><p>CSS 规范定义了三个主要来源，优先级从低到高排列：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>来源</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>优先级</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>用户代理样式（UA）</td>\n<td>浏览器内置默认样式</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>用户样式</td>\n<td>用户自定义样式表</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>作者样式</td>\n<td>开发者编写的样式</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> <code>!important</code> 声明会<strong>反转</strong>来源优先级——UA 的 <code>!important</code> 优先级最高，作者的 <code>!important</code> 反而较低。这是浏览器保护关键样式的机制。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"优先级计算\">优先级计算</h2><p>优先级（Specificity）用一个三元组 <code>(A, B, C)</code> 表示：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分量</th>\n<th>来源</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>A</td>\n<td>ID 选择器 <code>#id</code></td>\n<td><code>#header</code> → (1,0,0)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>B</td>\n<td>类、属性、伪类</td>\n<td><code>.nav[type]</code> → (0,2,0)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>C</td>\n<td>元素、伪元素</td>\n<td><code>div::before</code> → (0,0,2)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\"/* (0,0,1) — 仅一个元素选择器 */&#10;p {&#10;  color: black;&#10;}&#10;&#10;/* (0,1,1) — 一个类 + 一个元素 */&#10;p.intro {&#10;  color: blue;&#10;}&#10;&#10;/* (1,0,1) — 一个 ID + 一个元素 */&#10;#hero p {&#10;  color: red;&#10;}&#10;&#10;/* (1,1,1) — ID + 类 + 元素 */&#10;#hero p.intro {&#10;  color: green;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* (0,0,1) — 仅一个元素选择器 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  color</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">black</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* (0,1,1) — 一个类 + 一个元素 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">p</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.intro</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  color</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">blue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* (1,0,1) — 一个 ID + 一个元素 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">#hero</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  color</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">red</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* (1,1,1) — ID + 类 + 元素 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">#hero</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.intro</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  color</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">green</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>比较规则：先比 A，相同再比 B，再比 C。相同优先级时，后声明的规则胜出。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"important-与层叠反转\">!important 与层叠反转</h2><p><code>!important</code> 将声明提升到独立的&quot;重要声明&quot;层叠层，但同时<strong>反转</strong>了来源顺序：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph &quot;正常声明 (低→高)&quot;&#10;        N1[&quot;UA&quot;] --&gt; N2[&quot;用户&quot;] --&gt; N3[&quot;作者&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;!important 声明 (低→高)&quot;&#10;        I1[&quot;作者 !important&quot;] --&gt; I2[&quot;用户 !important&quot;] --&gt; I3[&quot;UA !important&quot;]&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph \"正常声明 (低→高)\"\n        N1[\"UA\"] --&gt; N2[\"用户\"] --&gt; N3[\"作者\"]\n    end\n    subgraph \"!important 声明 (低→高)\"\n        I1[\"作者 !important\"] --&gt; I2[\"用户 !important\"] --&gt; I3[\"UA !important\"]\n    end</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\"/* 作者样式 */&#10;.btn {&#10;  background: blue !important;&#10;}&#10;&#10;/* 用户代理样式中的 !important 会覆盖作者的 !important */&#10;/* 这就是为什么浏览器能保证 display:none 在 hidden 属性上生效 */\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 作者样式 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.btn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  background</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">blue</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> !important</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 用户代理样式中的 !important 会覆盖作者的 !important */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 这就是为什么浏览器能保证 display:none 在 hidden 属性上生效 */</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 滥用 <code>!important</code> 是样式难以维护的首要原因。优先通过提升优先级或使用 <code>@layer</code> 来解决冲突。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"layer-层叠层\">@layer 层叠层</h2><p>CSS <code>@layer</code> 允许开发者显式定义层叠层的优先级顺序，让优先级管理脱离选择器复杂度：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\"/* 声明层顺序：后声明的层优先级更高 */&#10;@layer reset, base, components, utilities;&#10;&#10;@layer reset {&#10;  * {&#10;    margin: 0;&#10;    padding: 0;&#10;    box-sizing: border-box;&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;@layer base {&#10;  body {&#10;    font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;&#10;    line-height: 1.6;&#10;  }&#10;  a {&#10;    color: currentColor;&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;@layer components {&#10;  .card {&#10;    border: 1px solid currentColor;&#10;    border-radius: 8px;&#10;    padding: 1rem;&#10;  }&#10;  .btn {&#10;    padding: 0.5rem 1rem;&#10;    border-radius: 4px;&#10;    cursor: pointer;&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;@layer utilities {&#10;  .hidden {&#10;    display: none;&#10;  }&#10;  .sr-only {&#10;    position: absolute;&#10;    width: 1px;&#10;    height: 1px;&#10;    overflow: hidden;&#10;    clip: rect(0 0 0 0);&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 声明层顺序：后声明的层优先级更高 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@layer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> reset, base, components, utilities;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@layer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> reset {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    margin</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    padding</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    box-sizing</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">border-box</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@layer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> base {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  body</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    font-family</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">system-ui</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sans-serif</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    line-height</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    color</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">currentColor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@layer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> components {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  .card</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    border</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">px</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> solid</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> currentColor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    border-radius</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">px</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    padding</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">rem</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  .btn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    padding</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">rem</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">rem</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    border-radius</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">px</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    cursor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">pointer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@layer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> utilities {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  .hidden</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    display</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">none</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  .sr-only</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    position</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">absolute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    width</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">px</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    height</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">px</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    overflow</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">hidden</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    clip</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">rect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>层叠层的核心规则：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;所有 @layer 声明&quot;] --&gt; B{&quot;层间顺序&quot;}&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;先声明的层 = 低优先级&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; D[&quot;后声明的层 = 高优先级&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; E[&quot;未分层样式 &gt; 所有层&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;未分层样式优先级最高&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"所有 @layer 声明\"] --&gt; B{\"层间顺序\"}\n    B --&gt; C[\"先声明的层 = 低优先级\"]\n    B --&gt; D[\"后声明的层 = 高优先级\"]\n    B --&gt; E[\"未分层样式 &gt; 所有层\"]\n    E --&gt; F[\"未分层样式优先级最高\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>行为</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>同层内冲突</td>\n<td>正常优先级 + 顺序规则</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨层冲突</td>\n<td>后声明层胜出，与选择器优先级无关</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>未分层 vs 层内</td>\n<td>未分层样式始终胜出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>嵌套层</td>\n<td><code>@layer framework.base</code> 支持子层</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"实战-优先级调试\">实战：优先级调试</h2><p>当样式不符合预期时，可以使用浏览器开发者工具的&quot;计算样式&quot;面板查看哪条规则最终胜出：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"html\" data-code=\"&lt;style&gt;&#10;  @layer base, theme;&#10;&#10;  @layer base {&#10;    .text {&#10;      color: gray;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  @layer theme {&#10;    .text {&#10;      color: steelblue;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  /* 未分层 — 优先级高于所有层 */&#10;  .text.highlight {&#10;    color: tomato;&#10;  }&#10;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;p class=&quot;text highlight&quot;&gt;这段文字是什么颜色？&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;!-- 答案：tomato，因为未分层样式优先级高于所有 @layer --&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">style</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  @layer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> base, theme;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  @layer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> base {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    .text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      color</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">gray</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  @layer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> theme {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    .text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      color</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">steelblue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  /* 未分层 — 优先级高于所有层 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  .text.highlight</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    color</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">tomato</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">style</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">p</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"text highlight\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>这段文字是什么颜色？&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">&#x3C;!-- 答案：tomato，因为未分层样式优先级高于所有 @layer --></span></span></code></pre></div><p>调试优先级的步骤：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>打开 DevTools → Elements → Styles 面板</li>\n<li>检查被划掉的规则，了解被覆盖原因</li>\n<li>查看 Computed 面板确认最终值</li>\n<li>使用 <code>@layer</code> 面板（Chrome 99+）查看层顺序</li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>层叠</strong>是 CSS 解决冲突的核心算法，依次考虑来源、<code>!important</code>、层叠层、优先级和出现顺序</li>\n<li><strong>优先级</strong>用三元组 <code>(A, B, C)</code> 计算，ID &gt; 类/属性/伪类 &gt; 元素/伪元素</li>\n<li><strong><code>!important</code></strong> 将声明提升到独立层并反转来源顺序，应谨慎使用</li>\n<li><strong><code>@layer</code></strong> 提供显式的优先级分层，让大型项目的样式管理更可预测</li>\n<li>未分层样式的优先级始终高于任何 <code>@layer</code> 内的样式</li>\n<li>优先通过架构手段（层叠层、选择器设计）而非 <code>!important</code> 来管理样式冲突</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"层叠与优先级","id":"层叠与优先级"},{"level":2,"text":"问题背景","id":"问题背景"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"层叠来源","id":"层叠来源"},{"level":2,"text":"优先级计算","id":"优先级计算"},{"level":2,"text":"!important 与层叠反转","id":"important-与层叠反转"},{"level":2,"text":"@layer 层叠层","id":"layer-层叠层"},{"level":2,"text":"实战：优先级调试","id":"实战-优先级调试"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"盒模型与布局模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/css-and-visual-engineering/fundamentals/box-model-and-layout-modes"}}